<Base title="Battery Energy Storage" description="40+ BESS sites delivered across California: excavation, underground, pads, equipment sets, conduit and wire." path="/battery-storage/">
<section id="bess"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Battery energy storage</p>
    <h1>Storage, built from the ground up.</h1>
    <p class="lead">More than 40 battery storage sites delivered across California, from the desert to the Bay Area. We self-perform the whole job: excavation, underground, concrete pads, equipment sets, conduit and wire, and the metering and disconnect assemblies, on live sites.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cgrid">
    <figure class="lead"><img src="/b-powerpack.jpg" alt="A row of Tesla Powerpack battery cabinets and inverter on a new pad" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Tesla Powerpack array</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="tall"><img src="/b-pick.jpg" alt="Battery cabinet lifted by crane from a flatbed truck" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Crane pick · National City</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="q"><img src="/b-combiner.jpg" alt="Storage combiner panelboard and metering enclosures on strut beside battery cabinets" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Combiner panel and metering</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="q"><img src="/b-fresno.jpg" alt="Battery storage cabinets installed beside electrical gear at a charging site" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Battery storage · Fresno</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="q"><img src="/b-meters.jpg" alt="Battery metering and disconnect assembly on strut" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Metering and disconnect · Murrieta</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="q"><img src="/b-baker.jpg" alt="Electrical gear and strut rack at a desert battery site" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Baker · high desert</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="half"><img src="/b-set.jpg" alt="Potential Electrical crew on a crane pick setting Tesla Powerpack battery cabinets" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Powerpacks set by crane</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="half"><img src="/b-cabinets.jpg" alt="Three battery storage cabinets set on a new pad with rebar dowels ready for the pad extension" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Storage cabinets set, pad extension next</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="half"><img src="/b-combiner2.jpg" alt="400A combiner panelboard, storage meter, site controller and gateway on galvanized strut" loading="lazy"><figcaption>400A combiner, metering and controls</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="half"><img src="/b-overhang.jpg" alt="Tesla Powerpack battery cabinets installed under a building overhang" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Powerpack install under a building overhang</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <ul class="ugfacts" aria-label="Battery storage scope">
    <li>Excavation and trenching</li><li>Underground conduit and duct banks</li><li>Concrete equipment pads</li><li>Crane picks and equipment sets</li><li>Conduit, wire and terminations</li><li>Metering, combiner and disconnect assemblies</li><li>Commissioning support</li>
  </ul>
</div></section>

